{
  "version": "2.0",
  "app": "bionodulo",
  "name": "Genome Assembly",
  "description": "De novo genome assembly with quality assessment",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "note_assembly_pipeline",
      "type": "note",
      "position": [
        -300,
        80
      ],
      "params": {
        "text": "Genome assembly example: trim paired reads, assemble with SPAdes or MEGAHIT, assess against a matched reference with Quast, and annotate bacterial contigs with Prokka.\n\nDefaults are Shovill's small paired-read assembly test and its matching Deinococcus radiodurans R1 plasmid MP1 reference (NC_000958.1; 177,466 bp). All three files are pinned to the same upstream revision. The 50,000 read pairs have matching accession-bearing headers; full-file sequence checks confirmed the reference pairing.\n\nThis is a bacterial plasmid tool-test fixture, not whole-genome or experimental validation. Replace reads and reference together for a study."
      },
      "ui": {
        "title": "Notes",
        "color": "#f59e0b"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "reads_001",
      "type": "input_fastq",
      "position": [
        80,
        414
      ],
      "params": {
        "sample_name": "genome1",
        "reads": [
          "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tseemann/shovill/9f0e6c72227309f2c95bc7ce22f804b587e84a0e/test/R1.fq.gz",
          "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tseemann/shovill/9f0e6c72227309f2c95bc7ce22f804b587e84a0e/test/R2.fq.gz"
        ]
      },
      "ui": {
        "title": "Input FASTQ",
        "validation": {
          "outputs": {
            "reads": {
              "expected_format": "fastq",
              "min_records": 1,
              "min_size_bytes": 1,
              "fail_on_error": true
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fastp_001",
      "type": "fastp",
      "position": [
        440,
        449
      ],
      "params": {
        "threads": 4
      },
      "ui": {
        "title": "fastp Trim"
      }
    },
    {
